codex
A more principled version of the first-layer correction is possible: for layer 0 the exact ReLU covariance is available because preactivations are jointly Gaussian. I’m testing a covariance match at only that layer to see whether it beats the tuned diagonal overshoot enough to justify the extra FLOPs.
